"M30 480l40-40\" fill=\"none\" pointer-events=\"stroke\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" style=\"stroke:#000\"></path></g></g><g data-cell-id=\"a4LEtKcCFJsA-SBCGBlo-52\"><g><path d=\"M110 480l-10-40\" fill=\"none\" pointer-events=\"stroke\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" style=\"stroke:#000\"></path></g></g><g data-cell-id=\"a4LEtKcCFJsA-SBCGBlo-53\"><g><path d=\"M190 480l-60-40\" fill=\"none\" pointer-events=\"stroke\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" style=\"stroke:#000\"></path></g></g><g data-cell-id=\"a4LEtKcCFJsA-SBCGBlo-54\"><g><path d=\"M310 480l40-40\" fill=\"none\" pointer-events=\"stroke\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" style=\"stroke:#000\"></path></g></g><g data-cell-id=\"a4LEtKcCFJsA-SBCGBlo-55\"><g><path d=\"M390 480l-10-40\" fill=\"none\" pointer-events=\"stroke\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" style=\"stroke:#000\"></path></g></g><g data-cell-id=\"a4LEtKcCFJsA-SBCGBlo-56\"><g><path d=\"M480 480l-55-40\" fill=\"none\" pointer-events=\"stroke\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" style=\"stroke:#000\"></path></g></g><g data-cell-id=\"a4LEtKcCFJsA-SBCGBlo-61\"><g><path d=\"M235 220.5h10v60h10.5l-15.5 19-15.5-19H235z\" fill=\"none\" pointer-events=\"all\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" style=\"stroke:#000\"></path></g></g></g></g></g></svg></div></div></div></div>",
