  "question": "<div class=\"content\"><p>若将关键字 1,2,3,4,5,6,7 依次插入到初始为空的平衡二叉树 T 中，则 T 中平衡因子为 0 的分支结点的个数是（ ）。</p>\n<div class=\"option\"><span class=\"opt-label\">A.</span><span class=\"opt-content\">0</span></div>\n<div class=\"option\"><span class=\"opt-label\">B.</span><span class=\"opt-content\">1</span></div>\n<div class=\"option\"><span class=\"opt-label\">C.</span><span class=\"opt-content\">2</span></div>\n<div class=\"option\"><span class=\"opt-label\">D.</span><span class=\"opt-content\">3</span></div></div>",
  "answer": "D",
