  "question": "<div class=\"content\"><p>下列选项中，不能构成折半查找中关键字比较序列的是（）。</p>\n<div class=\"option\"><span class=\"opt-label\">A.</span><span class=\"opt-content\">500,200,450,180</span></div>\n<div class=\"option\"><span class=\"opt-label\">B.</span><span class=\"opt-content\">500,450,200,180</span></div>\n<div class=\"option\"><span class=\"opt-label\">C.</span><span class=\"opt-content\">180,500,200,450</span></div>\n<div class=\"option\"><span class=\"opt-label\">D.</span><span class=\"opt-content\">180,200,500,450</span></div></div>",
  "answer": "A",
  "answerHtml": null,
